id: lingering-power-mark
name: Lingering Power
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 99
# Not a Combat Condition: Lingering Power (5)'s - its 2(bT) by the Past Life's base Tier, as stacks.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Lingering Power: Combat Rolls higher by a point a stack, till the end of your next turn.
text: >
  Lingering Power (5): Increase your Combat Rolls by 2(bT), using your Past Life's base Tier of Power to calculate the bonus, until the end of your next turn.

---

[passive per stack]
combatRolls += 1;
